  "description": "Redevelopment to provide two storey (4 bed) dwelling with lower ground floor level",
  "epc_number": null,
  "ward": "Stanmore",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-18T11:20:59.617Z",
  "street_name": "DENNIS LANE",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal, by reasons of the proposed dwelling which would infill a gap between buildings within the Metropolitan Green Belt resulting in a detrimental impact on the openness of the Green Belt, it has not been demonstrated to the satisfaction of the Local Planning Authority that the proposed dwelling would be an appropriate form of development within the Metropolitan Green Belt. There are no very special circumstances apparently that clearly outweigh the harm that the proposal would cause to the Metropolitan Green Belt by reason of inappropriateness and the impact on the openness and the character of the area. The proposal would therefore be contrary to policies S4(2c) and GB7 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2026), G2 of the London Plan (2021), and GI1A of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
